; A metadata line that a tag or link line separates from its posting is
; still the posting's: beancount reads each line of the body as a posting,
; a key-value or a tags line. The tag and link are reported and ignored.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2020-01-01 open Equity:E
2020-01-02 * "a tag line, then metadata"
  Assets:Cash  1 USD
    first: "direct"
  #tag
  third: "after the tag line"
  ^link
    fourth: "deeper"
  Equity:E
    own: "e"
